Package: nextraos-niri
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libwayland-server0
Suggests: xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: Niri Wayland compositor packaged for NextraOS
 Niri is a scrollable-tiling Wayland compositor. This package includes
 the upstream session entry, systemd user units and portal configuration.
 It does not provide a desktop shell, greeter, terminal or application
 launcher; NextraOS supplies those separately through its desktop stack.
